-value\">Secure Premium Box Packaging</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tourmaline-row\">\n      <span class=\"tourmaline-title\">Quality:</span>\n      <span class=\"tourmaline-value\">Handpicked Premium Grade Stone</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tourmaline-row\">\n      <span class=\"tourmaline-title\">Country of Origin:</span>\n      <span class=\"tourmaline-value\">India</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tourmaline-row\">\n      <span class=\"tourmaline-title\">Ideal For:</span>\n      <span class=\"tourmaline-value\">Daily Wear, Meditation & Spiritual Practices</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.tourmaline-dropdown {\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-btn {\n  width: 100%;\n  background: #f9fafb;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 18px 20px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-arrow {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-content {\n  display: none;\n  background: #fff;\n  padding: 18px 20px;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 20px;\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-row:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #374151;\n}\n\n.tourmaline-value {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  text-align: right;\n  max-width: 60%;\n}\n\n/* Mobile Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .tourmaline-row {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .tourmaline-value {\n    text-align: left;\n    max-width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .tourmaline-btn {\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\nconst tourmalineBtn = document.querySelector('.tourmaline-btn');\nconst tourmalineContent = document.querySelector('.tourmaline-content');\nconst tourmalineArrow = document.querySelector('.tourmaline-arrow');\n\ntourmalineBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  if (tourmalineContent.style.display === 'block') {\n    tourmalineContent.style.display = 'none';\n    tourmalineArrow.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';\n    tourmalineArrow.innerHTML = '+';\n  } else {\n    tourmalineContent.style.display = 'block';\n    tourmalineArrow.style.transform = 'rotate(45deg)';\n    tourmalineArrow.innerHTML = '×';\n  }\n});\n</script>"
          }
